@title Home-Office Stipend: Policy and How to Claim
@subtitle Larkspur Analytics, effective 2027-01-01

# Who is covered
If you work at least 3 days a week from home and have completed 90 days of service, you are covered. Part-time employees receive 50 percent of each amount on this page.

# What you get
- A one-time setup stipend of $500
- $40 a month toward your internet and phone
- You can claim the setup stipend again after 3 years

# What you can buy
You can use the setup stipend for a desk, chair, monitor, keyboard, headset and lighting.

# How to claim
1. Submit your receipts in the expense portal within 60 days of purchase.
2. For purchases over $250, get written approval from your manager before you buy.
3. Reimbursement arrives within 10 business days.

# What is not covered
- Gaming equipment
- Furniture for non-work use
- Software subscriptions
- Anything the company already supplies

# Questions
Email finance-help@larkspur.example or ask in the #finance-help channel. We are glad to help.
